<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vintage Petroleum raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vintage Petroleum raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst David Wheeler upgraded Vintage Petroleum Inc to buy from outperform, Wheeler's office confirmed.</p>
<p>-- Raised target price to $39 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-5/8 to 29-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
